help.main.nodeditor.intro=The <b>NOD Editor</b> is the workspace for creating and maintaining converter files. It combines a code editor, command tips, validation, test tools, templates and repair actions.
help.main.nodeditor.screenshot_caption=Example: a Celsius/Fahrenheit converter with the command tip for <code>input1</code>.
help.main.nodeditor.workflow.open=Open the editor with <b>Tools &gt; NOD Editor</b>, or open a specific <code>.nod</code> file.
