formula_card.card.vector-length-3d.title=3D vector length
formula_card.card.vector-length-3d.description=3D vector length is the length of the arrow from the origin to (x,y,z). Graph 3D shows the full XYZ arrow; Graph 2D can show the same vector as a perspective projection with (x/z,y/z), or as a plain X/Y arrow when z is zero.
